   "versionNonce": 8529,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "④ B 做完手头的 work，keep_working() 看到 nr_running > 1 → 退出循环回到空闲，nr_running 2→1",
   "originalText": "④ B 做完手头的 work，keep_working() 看到 nr_running > 1 → 退出循环回到空闲，nr_running 2→1",
